    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2283.png",
      "text": "'M'e,\" ho hoeletsa Lebo. \"Tloho u tlo bona. Liphahlo tsena kaofela li se li sa ntekane!\" \"E re ke li bone,\" ho rialo 'me oa hae.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ae96f0c8853c6e8e9784d436a69bb572940562798f9cd10d9f8923fd43c5081d"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2284.png",
      "text": "\"Bona mose oa ka oa letheka. O monyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea o bona,\" ho rialo 'Mae. \"Nthati o tla nka mose oa hao.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a55b0600c44550766854b480b6ce920febe0064c6a9a1099dbf89dc5279c91b9"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2285.png",
      "text": "\"Bona bolikhoe ba ka. Bo bonyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea bo bona\" ho rialo 'Mae. \"Nthati o tla nka bolikhoe ba hao.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:668bb0b848882d128aecf457eb8ec32c41c7c40ea0f5fedaa8f6d2df400bdf79"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2286.png",
      "text": "\"Bona sekipa sa ka. Se senyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea se bona,\" ho rialo 'm'e oa hae. \"Nthati o tla nka sekipa sa hao.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:c58d2b88a5e9369a850d284eea13dd9be254fd973e16f129c1230dfbfb684adc"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2287.png",
      "text": "\"Bona jesi ea ka. E nyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea e bona,\" ho rialo 'm'e oa hae. \"Nthati o tla nka jesi ea hao.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:420c397d57e0baae19d12634c91b8ea0a0e228b53ef27aa562e741e858fefdc2"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2288.png",
      "text": "\"Bona sekh'oehla sa ka. Se senyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea e bona,\" ho rialo 'm'e oa hae. \"Nthati o tla nka sekh'oehla.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ff1a6c9eba4c70432c41a748298efef7c0d8183ef081c4f81ccc3e6bed3b6268"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2289.png",
      "text": "\"Bona likausi tsa ka. Li nyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea li bona,\" ho rialo 'm'e oa hae. \"Nthati o tla nka likausi tsa hao.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:bf64bf7696478609e9314cea9efe5ab22ba6b3f09384b8e521cdc3588a1578d0"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2290.png",
      "text": "\"Bona lieta tsa ka. Li nyane haholo,\" ho rialo Lebo. \"E, kea li bona,\" ho rialo 'm'e oa hae. \"Nthati o tla nka lieta tsa hao.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:554b0e96cb28c66db92fdbda90492b2c93f9c762fce95458cb82c5f0a45fe4ab"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/2291.png",
      "text": "\"Bona u na le liphahlo tse ngata,\" ho rialo Lebo ho Nthati. \"Che che, ha ho joalo,\" ho rialo Nthati. \"Liphahlo tsena li kholo haholo ho 'na!\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36355#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:9c62499b85b1b82219b06a6f49354ce3b0bc1d5448897a9089901e80f9b344e0"
    }
